── Benchmark 2: SIMD Shuffle Throughput ────────────────────────────────

  float simd_shuffle              5.870 ms     279.1 Gshuffles/s    1116.5 GB/s
  float2 simd_shuffle             9.565 ms     171.3 Gshuffles/s    1370.3 GB/s

── Benchmark 3: Register ↔ Threadgroup Memory Copy ─────────────────────

  64 threads x 16 floats          0.544 ms    1925.9 GB/s
  128 threads x 16 floats         1.095 ms    1915.1 GB/s
  256 threads x 16 floats         2.056 ms    2039.9 GB/s
  512 threads x 16 floats         4.164 ms    2014.3 GB/s

── Benchmark 4: Occupancy vs Register Pressure ─────────────────────────

  ~8 GPRs  (1 float)              0.070 ms  maxThreads=1024  execWidth=32
  ~32 GPRs (16 floats)            0.153 ms  maxThreads=1024  execWidth=32
  ~64 GPRs (32 floats)            0.276 ms  maxThreads=1024  execWidth=32
  ~128 GPRs (64 floats)           0.529 ms  maxThreads=1024  execWidth=32

  Note: maxTotalThreadsPerThreadgroup reflects occupancy — lower values
  indicate the compiler allocated more registers, reducing concurrent threads.

