========================================================================
All benchmarks complete.

To run individual benchmarks:
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 1          # Threadgroup memory bandwidth
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 2          # SIMD shuffle throughput
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 3          # Register-to-threadgroup copy
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 4          # Occupancy vs register pressure
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 5          # Optimal thread count sweep
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 6          # vDSP FFT baseline
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks vdsp       # Same as 6
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 7          # Direct-matmul DFT (cblas_cgemm)
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks 8          # Radix-8 cblas_sgemm (AMX route)
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks amx-radix8 # Same as 8
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks tgmem      # Same as 1
  swift run FFTMicroBenchmarks shuffle     # Same as 2
